EXPENSES MANAGER V1.2b - README
------------------------------

This file is for users of V1.1 who wish to upgrade to V1.2  New users
should use the full instructions.

To upgrade from V1.1, replace the old S3AEXP1.APP file with the new S3AEXP2.APP.  
and in the sub-directory \APP\S3AEXP\ replace the .OVL files with the new versions.

    1.    If you want to use the optional On-Line Help (Highly recommended)
          put the file S3AEXPH.OVL into the \APP\S3AEXP\ directory.

    2.    If you want to use the optional Print option put the file 
          S3AEXPP.OVL into the \APP\S3AEXP\ directory and the file
          S3APRINT.DYL into an \OPD\ directory.  Note that this file is
          common to all my programs, so if you have more than one of
          them you only need one copy of this file.

The following major changes have occurred:

	a.	A proper printing routine based on the official Psion version.  
        	This also offers full PSIWIN support.  

	b.	A proper Psion-compatible Help file added.

	c.	Swiss font has been added as an option.  Select through
		'Set Preferences'.

	d.	As well as 'Business' and 'Personal' categories, you can now use
		'Unallocated' as a distance category.  

Hope you like the improvements.

Al
